OL,3,ANandy 'minded to intervene' in Sky's
OL,4,A#1.6bn takeover of ITV entertainment
OL,5,Aarm
OL,6,
OL,7,FCulture Secretary Lisa Nandy has said
OL,8,Fshe is "minded to intervene" in the
OL,9,Fproposed #1.6bn deal for Sky to buy
OL,10,FITV's media and entertainment division.
OL,12,FNandy said there were reasonable
OL,13,Fgrounds to believe the deal could
OL,14,Faffect free expression in the media and
OL,15,Fthe variety of Britain's news
OL,16,Flandscape.
OL,18,FSky said it would "carefully consider"
OL,19,Fa letter from the culture secretary and
OL,20,F"engage constructively" with the review
OL,21,Finto the deal.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
